:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">tencent/Hy3</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">腾讯发布的Hy3模型，旨在为各类人工智能应用提供基础支持。该模型专注于中文语境下的自然语言处理能力，通过腾讯的技术积累，优化了语义理解与生成质量，适用于智能对话、文本分析及内容创作等多种场景，旨在提升大模型的中文处理效率与交互体验。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-14/02-empero-ai-qwythos-9b-claude-mythos-5-1m-gguf.png\" alt=\"empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">empero-ai/Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwythos-9B-Claude-Mythos-5-1M-GGUF是基于特定量化格式封装的模型，专为低资源环境及边缘端推理设计。该模型通过Mythos相关优化，支持长上下文处理，主要用于各类创意写作、角色扮演以及文本生成任务。用户可利用GGUF格式在消费级硬件上快速部署并运行，以获取灵活的推理体验。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-14/03-zai-org-glm-5-2.png\" alt=\"zai-org/GLM-5.2\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">zai-org/GLM-5.2</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">GLM-5.2是由zai-org开发的一款高性能通用大语言模型。作为GLM系列的重要迭代，该模型在逻辑推理、知识储备及指令遵循方面进行了显著增强。它提供API服务及在线测试平台，广泛适用于企业级自动化办公、复杂任务处理及智能助手开发，体现了在多模态理解与生成方面的技术进步。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-14/04-bottlecapai-thinkingcap-qwen3-6-27b.png\" alt=\"bottlecapai/ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">bottlecapai/ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">ThinkingCap-Qwen3.6-27B是一款基于Qwen架构深度定制的模型，由BottleCap AI优化。该模型参数量为27B，强调思维链（CoT）推理能力，旨在解决复杂的逻辑任务、编码及深层分析工作。适合需要高精度推理和复杂问题求解的专业用户，能够在科研探索、高级代码编写及复杂决策场景中发挥重要作用。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-07-14/05-conradlocke-krea2-identity-edit.png\" alt=\"conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Krea2-identity-edit是一款专注于图像编辑的专业工具，旨在实现精准的身份保留与局部修改。版本v1.1改进了人脸相似度与编辑区域约束，在保持构图稳定性方面表现出色，特别适用于双人图像处理及精细的对象替换任务。开发者推荐在1-1.5MP分辨率下使用，并提供不同秩的量化版本以适配低显存需求。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\